---
module: task-manager
func_id: add-task
---

***conformance tests***

# add-a-task
A :User: opens the `Add New Task` modal with the `Add New Task` button, enters the task name `Buy milk`, the description `Two liters` and the due date 9 October, and chooses `Save`. :TaskList: then shows one :Task: with the name `Buy milk`, the description `Two liters` and the date `9. Oct`.

# add-a-task-with-the-name-only
A :User: opens the `Add New Task` modal, enters the task name `Buy milk` and chooses `Save`. :TaskList: then shows one :Task: named `Buy milk`.

# cancel-adding-a-task
A :User: opens the `Add New Task` modal, enters the task name `Buy milk` and chooses `Cancel`. The modal closes and :TaskList: stays empty.

***acceptance tests***
